{"seq":7,"slug":"low-altitude-technology","title":"低空技术与工程","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/university/interdisciplinary/low-altitude-technology","introMarkdown":"# 低空技术与工程 简介\n\n低空技术与工程是面向3000米以下空域运行的新工科交叉学科，涵盖无人机（UAV）、电动垂直起降飞行器（eVTOL）等新型航空器的设计、控制、运行管理与产业应用。2025年秋季，北京航空航天大学等6所高校首批招生，标志着该学科正式纳入高等教育体系。\n\n本课程体系以\"飞行器设计→智能控制→空域管理→适航法规\"为主线，融合航空工程、人工智能、通信导航、交通管理等多学科知识，培养能够胜任低空经济全链条技术岗位的复合型工程人才。\n\n课程适合航空航天工程、自动化、电子信息、交通运输等专业背景的本科高年级及研究生阶段学习者，也适合无人机行业从业者系统化提升理论储备。\n\n全书分为四章，逻辑递进：\n\n第1章**飞行器设计基础**从低空空气动力学入手，系统讲解无人机系统总体设计方法与eVTOL城市空中交通技术，建立对低空飞行器\"造什么、怎么造\"的完整认知。\n\n第2章**智能控制与导航**聚焦飞行器\"如何飞\"的核心能力，涵盖飞行控制系统、导航定位技术以及多机协同与集群智能三大方向。\n\n第3章**空域管理与法规**解决\"在哪飞、怎么管\"的问题，包括低空空域体系架构、无人机交通管理系统（UTM）以及适航审定与运行法规。\n\n第4章**应用与产业**面向\"飞来做什么\"，分析物流配送、巡检监测两大核心场景，并从产业经济视角审视低空经济的商业模式与发展前景。\n\n推荐学习路径：先掌握第1章飞行器硬件基础，再学习第2章控制与导航软件能力，然后理解第3章运行管理框架，最后通过第4章将技术落地到具体应用场景。具备飞行力学、自动控制或通信基础的学习者可根据兴趣选择性深入。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"aircraft-design-fundamentals","title":"飞行器设计基础","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/interdisciplinary/low-altitude-technology/aircraft-design-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"aerodynamics-fundamentals","title":"低空空气动力学","url":"/education/university/interdisciplinary/low-altitude-technology/aircraft-design-fundamentals/aerodynamics-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"uav-system-design","title":"无人机系统设计","url":"/education/university/interdisciplinary/low-altitude-technology/aircraft-design-fundamentals/uav-system-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"evtol-technology","title":"eVTOL技术与城市空中交通","url":"/education/university/interdisciplinary/low-altitude-technology/aircraft-design-fundamentals/evtol-technology"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"intelligent-control-navigation","title":"智能控制与导航","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/interdisciplinary/low-altitude-technology/intelligent-control-navigation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"flight-control-systems","title":"飞行控制系统","url":"/education/university/interdisciplinary/low-altitude-technology/intelligent-control-navigation/flight-control-systems"},{"seq":2,"slug":"navigation-positioning","title":"导航与定位技术","url":"/education/university/interdisciplinary/low-altitude-technology/intelligent-control-navigation/navigation-positioning"},{"seq":3,"slug":"multi-uav-collaboration","title":"多机协同与集群智能","url":"/education/university/interdisciplinary/low-altitude-technology/intelligent-control-navigation/multi-uav-collaboration"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"airspace-management","title":"空域管理与法规","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/interdisciplinary/low-altitude-technology/airspace-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"low-altitude-airspace","title":"低空空域管理体系","url":"/education/university/interdisciplinary/low-altitude-technology/airspace-management/low-altitude-airspace"},{"seq":2,"slug":"utm-systems","title":"无人机交通管理系统","url":"/education/university/interdisciplinary/low-altitude-technology/airspace-management/utm-systems"},{"seq":3,"slug":"airworthiness-regulations","title":"适航审定与法规体系","url":"/education/university/interdisciplinary/low-altitude-technology/airspace-management/airworthiness-regulations"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"applications-and-industry","title":"应用与产业","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/interdisciplinary/low-altitude-technology/applications-and-industry","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"logistics-delivery","title":"低空物流与即时配送","url":"/education/university/interdisciplinary/low-altitude-technology/applications-and-industry/logistics-delivery"},{"seq":2,"slug":"inspection-monitoring","title":"巡检与监测应用","url":"/education/university/interdisciplinary/low-altitude-technology/applications-and-industry/inspection-monitoring"},{"seq":3,"slug":"low-altitude-economy","title":"低空经济生态","url":"/education/university/interdisciplinary/low-altitude-technology/applications-and-industry/low-altitude-economy"}]}]}